NOAA EMC Unified Post Processor (UPP)

HRRR's MASSDEN smoke field is written by UPP's sorc/ncep_post.fd/MDLFLD.f
as (1/RD)(P/T) times the smoke mixing ratio over 1e9, with RD = 287.04 from
params.F (https://github.com/NOAA-EMC/UPP, commit
1296eebb295251d0fe1cc697f47058c62d887977). The smoke option's decode
(tools/grib1_bridge/src/chem_conversions.rs) cites those two files so a
reader can check the field definition it inverts; the inverse is WOOF's
own algebra and no UPP source ships with WOOF. The oracle harness
(tools/chem_wrf471_oracle/build_source_conversion.sh) downloads the two
pinned files at build time to compile that one statement. UPP is
distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3.

