under the Apache License, Version 2.0; its licence ships inside the package
as woof/hex/data/licenses/metis-LICENSE and in the source tree as
licenses/LICENSE-METIS-Apache-2.0.txt.

GKlib/getopt.c, GKlib/gkregex.c and GKlib/gkregex.h, which the METIS
tarball carries as copies of GNU C Library code under the LGPL-2.1, are not
in this distribution and are not compiled. GKlib/gk_mksort.h, which in the
