keeps, in a block that is not compiled, the MT19937-64 code of Makoto
Matsumoto and Takuji Nishimura (Copyright (C) 2004) with its BSD-style
notice. hex_gpmetis is a separate program that the door runs as a
subprocess; its complete source and build script ship in the sdist (any
gpmetis on PATH, or the --gpmetis option, is used instead when hex_gpmetis
is absent or named otherwise).

